     "4321fefa-1ed1-443d-8c66-1ada4a047e7c"], Cell["\<\
one directed acyclic graph encoding all members by elapsed step and retained \
path history, with a terminal state\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"46c48b4a-b1a6-4d91-ad47-5feb72c325df"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
