    "the number of members containing each substrate vertex", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"fa65bfe4-761b-4a57-9c2a-ab5930680166"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f7eb03d9-324c-430c-9a6d-34de5af940df"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
